# 40. First Vertical Slice

The first complete benchmark experiment is:

```text
                 MISRAJ
                    │
                 400 pages
                    │
                    ▼
                 Docling
                    │
                    ▼
               Prediction
                    │
                    ▼
              Normalization
                    │
                    ▼
              CER / WER
                    │
          ┌─────────┴─────────┐
          ▼                   ▼
        Micro               Macro
          │                   │
          └─────────┬─────────┘
                    ▼
                Results
