## The central rule

> **Build only what is required to turn the three characterized datasets into reproducible evidence across the candidate engines. Nothing more.**

The first implementation target is therefore unambiguous:

```text
Docling × Misraj × 400
        ↓
CER/WER
        ↓
raw + normalized
